{"id":"vod_md_2415","vodId":"2415","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"爱杀宝贝日语版","name_cn":"爱杀宝贝日语版","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230814-1/1e7c9fc3d33cbd126b390151664a6579.jpg"},"summary":"表面上看来，索尼娅（田村睦心 配音）是一个扎着双马尾的金发美少女高中生，但实际上，她有着一个秘密的身份——杀手。作为一名杀手，索尼娅有着异常敏锐的神经，任何突然靠近她的生物，都会受到她的强力攻击。少女折部安奈（赤崎千夏 配音）自称是索尼娅的朋友，但似乎没有得到索尼娅的认可。因为其大大咧咧的天然呆个性，安奈经常成为索尼娅本能攻击的受害者。在无意间，安奈发现，虽然索尼娅是个令人闻风丧胆的杀手，但她在昆虫和妖怪方面却有着意外小的胆量，这也成为了拉近二人关系的重要契机。同时，索尼娅的杀手同事吴织亚切（高部爱 配音），毫无存在感的不知名少女（钉宫理惠 配音）也来到了安奈的身边，杀手和少女们热闹的日常生活展开了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-14 08:12:21","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/B7onm66R/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/l0jc0FN8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/D9hYXhCm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/vCo8nEKP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/gfeN7BG1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/pG7mnNAV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/okr4jJCG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/7Vbkgm7B/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/BMqxL0xt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/aa9XG6ws/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/MsEhQ8eo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/03CyuScp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/u4Brn1ZT/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:35:19.205Z"}